---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const operator = `${SITE.author.name}, ${SITE.author.country}`;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles personal data, cookies, analytics and advertising, and what choices you have.`}
>
  <article class="narrow article-head prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: {SITE.legalUpdated}</p>

    <p>
      This policy explains what information {SITE.name} ("we", "us", "the site") collects, how it is used and what choices you have.
      The site is operated by {operator}. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information you send us.</strong> If you email us, we receive your email address and message and use them only to reply.</li>
      <li><strong>Automatically collected information.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting and analytics tools may collect your IP address, browser and device type, pages visited and the page that referred you.</li>
      <li>We do not require registration and we do not sell personal data.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Cookies are small files stored in your browser. We and our partners use cookies and similar technologies to run the site, measure traffic and show advertising.
      Where the law requires it, you will be asked for consent before non-essential cookies are used. You can also delete or block cookies in your browser settings, although parts of the site may then work differently.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.analyticsId
        ? 'We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site, for example which pages are read most. The data is aggregated and used to improve content.'
        : 'We may use privacy-conscious analytics to understand how visitors use the site. If we add a tool that sets cookies, this section will name it.'}
    </p>

    <h2>4. Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense to display advertising. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this site and other sites on the internet.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and/or other sites.</li>
      <li>You can opt out of personalized advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>You can opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
      <li>You can read how Google uses data from sites that use its services at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Third-party links</h2>
    <p>The site may link to other websites. We are not responsible for their content or privacy practices.</p>

    <h2>6. How long we keep data</h2>
    <p>
      Emails are kept for as long as needed to answer you and for a reasonable period afterwards. Analytics data is kept according to the settings of the analytics provider.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live, for example in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom or Turkey, you may have the right to access, correct or delete your personal data,
      to restrict or object to its use and to withdraw consent. To exercise these rights, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Children</h2>
    <p>The site is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their personal data.</p>

    <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date above shows when it last changed.</p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
